5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,We should start by checking which of these options relies on conditions we cannot control.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a wise starting point. I am curious to see which proposals depend on external factors we cannot easily manage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to look at the old records! We keep forgetting what we already tried.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the funding structure is the real trap here, not the size of the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I need to verify if the required skills actually exist on our current roster before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, your instinct is sound. Let us see what the past tells us before we build new plans.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The shape of the funding matters more than the headline number.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, I agree! But we also need to check the old attendance sheets to see what actually worked before.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, I appreciate the enthusiasm, but let us not conflate past attendance with sustainable financial models.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I hear you, but a sustainable model is useless if no one on staff can actually run it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, you are right. We must ensure our people are ready before we promise anything new to the community.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, precisely. The physical location and opening hours dictate who can actually reach us, so we must map that carefully.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, but what if the old stops worked better because people could actually get there? We should check the bus links too!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the bus links are a variable, but the funding structure is the constant. I will examine the grant terms and the endowment to see how the money is actually shaped.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I will check the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the capacity to manage external partners.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the winter road closures and the evening room bookings to see how conditions affect our reach.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the bus links in the outer wards and the evening room bookings to understand access constraints.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I will review the county grant terms and the endowment, alongside last year’s running and equipment lines.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I will review the volunteer register and supervision training, plus the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
